03cdb529687a-95ea-98f8-201af8b0e3ff	2025-07-18 16:53:23+00	2025-07-18 16:53:23+00	0	<p>The following things are not added in the PR:<br>\n<br data-tomark-pass=""></p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>Conversations always opened:</strong><br>\nThe reason behind that is simple, if a conversation has 10_ comments, because of the very small frame of the weekly conversations widgets, user have to scroll down a way to see their concerned conversation. That matter can easily be solved if conversations are closed by default, and through that user can easily open the conversation (related to a issue) they need. Moreover we can change this to always opened if there are suggestions raised by the end users.</li>\n<li><strong>Link generation for the conversation (route user to issue detail view):</strong><br>\nThere is no direct linking of the comment to the project. So in order to route to the issue detail view, we need the project short code. That's why routing to the issue detail view as well as the conversation page is not possible due to the limited resources. If the project shortcode is added, then we can easily generate links. But these links will always redirect the user to the conversation route instead of the issue detail view because the conversation/comment model also doesn't have issueNumber as a field.</li>\n</ol>\n	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	conversationrooms	07d507b96876-e0cc-535b-db03190ac4df	Rana Nouman	Rana Nouman	\N
