07bdb25667fd-73ae-c1ff-99b2a7be9f28	2025-04-14 14:09:11+00	2025-04-14 14:09:11+00	0	<p>For that feature we have to align the position of the button actions of the JQuery query builder using two options, 1 using css and other using DOM manipulation.</p>\n<p><strong>Using CSS:</strong><br>\nAs the number of rules is going to increase, the add rule/group buttons will be positioned under the list. So this will not work.</p>\n<p><strong>Using JS:</strong><br>\n- After trying to change the element parent using ember rendering events, the JQuery is unable to find the actual parent of the element and fails to add a rule/group by showing the error.</p>\n<p>Moreover, we also cannot handle nested button rendering right now.. The UI can break at any time because of the above issues.</p>\n<p>So closing this issue right now and going with the default UI is good from my side. Please let me know your thoughts on this.</p>\n	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	conversationrooms	072ba95367fd-73ae-c1ff-6d2d397a500e	Rana Nouman	Rana Nouman	\N
