02dad7a96749-639d-0020-2424206c9254	CD workflow for digital ocean not required	2024-11-29 09:57:22+00	2024-11-29 11:00:06+00	0	<p>As we had migrated gaia from Digital Ocean to OVH cloud, we don't CD workflow to trigger on pull request merge. So either delete this or make this part of legacy under workflows/legacy/ directory.</p>\n	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	3488	2024-11-29	2024-11-29	done	medium	cb4567905acd-06d6-1141-7dd99b59dd21	29393e98671f-f433-141c-87c17da1ce69	\N	cbaa72735acd-06d6-1141-98f835ab32e9	Rana Nouman	Rana Nouman	24418eb36749-6641-cba4-49f223a9437f	33f2e1c062c6-81f4-bcaf-6a1b411477d8	2024-11-29 11:00:06+00	AGAIA	0	0
0300d8f9674f-7f25-1b25-dc3b1e96dd66	Add more customization in routes	2024-12-03 13:05:07+00	2025-01-30 10:16:10+00	0	<p>We need to add some more configuration in our routes which we're doing right now in Gaia. We can only map GET method to "get" Action to the controller and the same goes for other HTTP methods. Like if when we make an API call of GET type, getAction is called from the specified controller. We don't have the ability right now to add more actions under the GET call like validateResetToken or any other. For that purpose, we're currently following the approach of creating a new Controller and using that getAction instead of relying on methods inside the controller. For example, we can't do the following right now:<br>\n<br data-tomark-pass=""></p>\n<pre><code>/api/v1/reset-password/validate-token\n</code></pre>\n<p><br data-tomark-pass=""><br>\n<strong>Implementation:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Find out the structure for handling multiple methods other than default HTTP-mapped methods.</li>\n<li>Update the router.php file to make all of the scenarios workable.</li>\n</ul>\n	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	3492	2024-12-03	2024-12-03	deferred	medium	cb4567905acd-06d6-1141-7dd99b59dd21	29393e98671f-f433-141c-87c17da1ce69	\N	cbaa72735acd-06d6-1141-98f835ab32e9	Rana Nouman	Rana Nouman	534841b7674f-deba-1b25-75a5db0865e8	6127443762c6-81f4-bcaf-98ca7149ed20	2025-01-30 10:16:10+00	AGAIA	0	0
