07cca95266d7-ea0a-9cab-ab1d33cb6a82	Error while fetching issues	2024-09-03 14:15:35+00	2024-09-04 09:59:50+00	0	<p><strong>Background:</strong><br>\nUsers encounter errors while fetching issues from the server.</p>\n<p><strong>Acceptance Criteria:</strong><br>\nIssues should be fetched without any error.</p>\n<p><strong>Steps to Reproduce:</strong><br>\n1. Go to application "/app" route.<br>\n2. Observe an error on this route.</p>\n<p><strong>Root Cause Analysis:</strong><br>\nWhen a new user is created, a role named "Global role" is given to the user to assign initial default ACL permissions. While setting up the Global role, we set the Project module "Read" action to Assignment (To enable users to see only the projects on which they have a membership). So while fetching issues on&nbsp;<strong>/app</strong> route we get an error because the user is initially not a member of even 1 project. So the SQL prepared in the backend causes the error as below:<br>\n<br data-tomark-pass=""></p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><span class="colour" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);" data-tomark-pass="">PhalconException: Syntax error, unexpected token ), near to ' left JOIN [\\Gaia\\MVC\\Models\\Issuestatus] AS [issuestatus] ON Issue.statusId = issuestatus.id WHERE (((Issue.assignee = '44cbe3d4660b-38a5-cb58-498b12dbd6df') AND ((Issue.startDate BETWEEN '2024-09-03 00:00:00' AND '2024-09-03 23:59:59') OR (issuestatus.name = 'in_progress')))) AND (Issue.deleted = '0') ORDER BY Issue.dateModified ASC', when parsing: SELECT Issue.id, Issue.subject, Issue.dateCreated, Issue.dateModified, Issue.lastActivityDate, Issue.deleted, Issue.description, Issue.createdUser, Issue.createdUserName, Issue.owner, Issue.assignee, Issue.reportedUser, Issue.modifiedUser, Issue.modifiedUserName, Issue.issueNumber, Issue.endDate, Issue.startDate, Issue.typeId, Issue.status, Issue.statusId, Issue.priority, Issue.projectId, Issue.milestoneId, Issue.parentId, Issue.conversationRoomId, createdBy.*, modifiedBy.*, project.*, issuestatus.* FROM [Gaia\\MVC\\Models\\Issue] AS [Issue] left JOIN [\\Gaia\\MVC\\Models\\User] AS [createdBy] ON Issue.createdUser = createdBy.id left JOIN [\\Gaia\\MVC\\Models\\User] AS [modifiedBy] ON Issue.modifiedUser = modifiedBy.id left JOIN [\\Gaia\\MVC\\Models\\Project] AS [project] ON Issue.projectId = project.id AND project.id IN <strong>()</strong> left JOIN [\\Gaia\\MVC\\Models\\Issuestatus] AS [issuestatus] ON Issue.statusId = issuestatus.id WHERE (((Issue.assignee = '44cbe3d4660b-38a5-cb58-498b12dbd6df') AND ((Issue.startDate BETWEEN '2024-09-03 00:00:00' AND '2024-09-03 23:59:59') OR (issuestatus.name = 'in_progress')))) AND (Issue.deleted = '0') ORDER BY Issue.dateModified ASC (1156)</span></p>\n</blockquote>\n	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	3428	2024-09-03	2024-09-03	done	medium	cb4567905acd-06d6-1141-7dd99b59dd21	ca899ac066d6-98bf-431e-a72d47430c7b	\N	cb9597e45acd-06d6-1141-34137d85f7a9	Rana Nouman	Rana Nouman	\N	33f2e1c062c6-81f4-bcaf-6a1b411477d8	2024-09-04 09:59:50+00	AGAIA	0	0
