0819e5b5678e-5527-319f-24edc1a97597	Add pencil icon on project's member to edit membership	2025-01-20 13:22:16+00	2026-02-27 22:18:06+00	0	<p><strong>Description</strong>:<br>\nAdd a pencil icon next to each project member in the UI to allow editing of their membership details.</p>\n<p><strong>Purpose</strong>:<br>\nThis feature will improve usability by enabling users to quickly edit the membership details of project members directly from the project's page.</p>\n<p><strong>Requirements</strong>:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Display a pencil icon adjacent to each member's name in the <strong>project members' list</strong>.</li>\n<li>On clicking the icon:\n<ul>\n<li>Open an <strong>Edit Membership Modal</strong>.</li>\n<li>Pre-fill the modal with the selected member's current details.</li>\n<li>Allow updating fields such as role given to the member, or other editable attributes.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>Acceptance Criteria</strong>:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Pencil icon is visible next to each member in the list.</li>\n<li>Clicking the icon opens the Edit Membership modal.</li>\n<li>The modal is pre-filled with the correct member details.</li>\n<li>Updates made in the modal are saved and reflected immediately in the UI.</li>\n<li>The feature is responsive and works across all supported devices and browsers.</li>\n<li>Acceptance test cases are added for the new functionality.</li>\n</ul>\n	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	3515	2025-01-21	2025-01-20	done	medium	add12ff55acb-1902-6b9c-30d5411f7729	d887604167a0-5985-d8e3-056674b53f37	\N	ae5c14575acb-1902-6b9c-78da78712ee9	Rana Nouman	Rana Nouman	1e35884669a2-3d5b-f40f-a2191e082a18	23a4749162c6-89cf-bcaf-50ebb8c0446b	2025-02-14 18:13:48+00	APROM	0	0
