08678e806798-f2d2-e684-2c4029d0cdb2	Route using query params not working as expected	2025-01-28 07:23:52+00	2025-01-28 14:41:19+00	0	<p>It works perfectly when routing a specific route without using query parameters. After using query params inside that route, using button click (for pagination), the route is working as expected but when we directly add query params inside the URL and do a full page reload it shows the error as below:<br>\n<br data-tomark-pass=""></p>\n<pre><code>router.js:993 Uncaught TypeError: Cannot read properties of undefined (reading 'name')\n    at Class._queryParamsFor (router.js:993:1)\n    at Class.finalizeQueryParamChange (route.js:1863:1)\n    at Class.triggerEvent (router.js:1453:1)\n    at PrivateRouter.triggerEvent (router.js:270:1)\n    at PrivateRouter.finalizeQueryParamChange (router_js.js:1953:1)\n    at PrivateRouter.queryParamsTransition (router_js.js:1448:1)\n    at PrivateRouter.getTransitionByIntent (router_js.js:1520:1)\n    at PrivateRouter.transitionByIntent (router_js.js:1469:1)\n    at PrivateRouter.doTransition (router_js.js:1605:1)\n    at PrivateRouter.transitionTo (router_js.js:2077:1)\n</code></pre>\n<p><br data-tomark-pass=""><br>\n<strong>Current Behavior:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Route using query params using full page reload removes the query params from the URL and shows the error as shown in the image above.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Expected Behavior:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>User should be routed to a specific route and query params should work as expected without causing any error.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Steps to Reproduce:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Signin to application</li>\n<li>Now use the URL&nbsp;<a href="http://prom.projects4.me/app/project/aprom/issue?page=2">http://prom.projects4.me/app/project/aprom/issue?page=2</a>&nbsp;and make a full page reload.</li>\n<li>Query params will be removed and the user will see an error as stated above.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><br data-tomark-pass=""><br>\n<strong>Reference Links:</strong><br>\n<a href="https://github.com/emberjs/ember.js/issues/17118">https://github.com/emberjs/ember.js/issues/17118</a></p>\n	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	3521	2025-01-29	2025-01-28	done	medium	add12ff55acb-1902-6b9c-30d5411f7729	10c7a2216788-d753-eb27-75c3c2c13446	\N	ae5c14575acb-1902-6b9c-78da78712ee9	Rana Nouman	Rana Nouman	\N	23a4749162c6-89cf-bcaf-50ebb8c0446b	2025-01-28 14:44:54+00	APROM	0	0
