1a319ec367d9-bb36-ef4a-0faa1e368a35	Remain open the messenger until the data is exported successfully	2025-03-18 11:29:30+00	2026-02-27 21:25:27+00	0	<p>For now, the messenger ui (notification) related to the exporting of the data is dropped after few seconds. Let's say if there is some time taken by the server on processing csvs and exporting data, user will have no indication on what's going on. So making the messenger open until the data is exported successfully is a good indication to have.</p>\n	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	3563	2025-03-19	2025-03-18	done	medium	add12ff55acb-1902-6b9c-30d5411f7729	2d5e52f467da-bc46-b006-0fa9d50bc26f	\N	ae5c14575acb-1902-6b9c-78da78712ee9	Rana Nouman	Rana Nouman	\N	23a4749162c6-89cf-bcaf-50ebb8c0446b	2025-03-18 11:44:34+00	APROM	0	0
1b5ad2a86850-6495-2865-c285c8cf509e	Migrate from JQuery Datatable from our custom table implementation	2025-06-16 13:11:55+00	2025-06-18 12:19:12+00	0	<ul>\n<li>The migration will include changing of widgets implementation.</li>\n<li>Removing DataTables integration from the project.</li>\n<li>Adding more information to the&nbsp;<strong>metadata.</strong></li>\n<li>Creating a custom generic table component that will be used for any purpose.</li>\n<li>Providing the information to the table and rendering of the default (<strong>2</strong>) widgets.</li>\n<li>Conversion of widgets from <strong>"Issue Today"</strong> to <strong>"Recent Issues"</strong> and <strong>"Weekly Milestones"</strong> to "<strong>Active Milestones"</strong>.</li>\n<li>Providing a generic searching functionality in table component (custom <strong>callback</strong> can also be provided).</li>\n<li>Adding common implemenation of the widgets in the <strong>Widget</strong> component.</li>\n<li>Integrating <strong>Sortable</strong> to <strong>widgets</strong> container.</li>\n<li>Removing the Legacy Widget component and creating a new <strong>Glimmer</strong> component that every Widget will extend as a <strong>base class</strong>.</li>\n<li>Fixing Acceptance test cases</li>\n<li>Adding new integration test cases for new components</li>\n</ul>\n	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	3637	2025-06-16	2025-06-10	done	high	add12ff55acb-1902-6b9c-30d5411f7729	ed2cb267684f-a69a-78f2-33679d279fdc	790b71f96839-4a83-4657-d977a511cf18	ae5c14575acb-1902-6b9c-78da78712ee9	Rana Nouman	Rana Nouman	\N	5ff1668262c6-8aad-bcaf-01beaeb4190e	2025-06-17 16:04:29+00	APROM	0	0
