1c003fd167cf-d5e7-e900-31cb7dc163bb	 Implement Export Action to Export Module Data in CSV Format	2025-03-11 06:50:04+00	2025-03-16 11:59:16+00	0	<p>We need to implement a new action in our Rest Controller that allows users to export module data in CSV format. The action should accept the module name and module IDs as query parameters or in the POST body, fetch the relevant data, prepare the CSV, and return the CSV link to the client.</p>\n<p><strong>Implementation:</strong></p>\n<ol data-tomark-pass=""><li data-tomark-pass="">Implement an **exportAction** method that:<ul data-tomark-pass=""><li data-tomark-pass="">Accepts **moduleName** and **moduleIds** as query parameters.</li><li data-tomark-pass="">Validates the input parameters.</li><li data-tomark-pass="">Fetches metadata for the specified module.</li><li data-tomark-pass="">Fetches data for the specified module IDs based on the metadata.</li><li data-tomark-pass="">Prepares a CSV file with the fetched data.</li><li data-tomark-pass="">Returns the CSV file link in the response.</li></ul></li><li data-tomark-pass="">Implement CSV util that will be used to create CSVs (creating files, adding data,a and returning csvs).</li><li data-tomark-pass="">Implement Zip util that will get multiple files and create a zip archive for that.</li></ol>\n	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	3561	2025-03-12	2025-03-11	done	medium	cb4567905acd-06d6-1141-7dd99b59dd21	887018e167bc-c8dc-e605-26351bc4e5a8	\N	cbaa72735acd-06d6-1141-98f835ab32e9	Rana Nouman	Rana Nouman	\N	33f2e1c062c6-81f4-bcaf-6a1b411477d8	2025-03-16 11:54:57+00	AGAIA	0	0
