5e5609f7674d-3940-af00-5ddfbbd96a00	Handle reset password's token generation	2024-12-02 12:38:54+00	2024-12-02 14:22:09+00	0	<p><strong>Background:</strong><br>\nWhile creating a reset password link, we need an identifier through which we can securely handle the password update functionality. That identifier can be used for the link expiration.</p>\n<p><br data-tomark-pass=""><br>\n<strong>Implementation:</strong></p>\n<ul data-tomark-pass=""><li data-tomark-pass="">Create a 20 or more character-long identifier that will be set against each user, naming that identifier as a **resetToken.**</li><li data-tomark-pass="">Once the user's email is validated, create and store a new reset token against the user and set an expiration time for that.</li><li data-tomark-pass="">Embed this token in the reset password link which will be sent out the email to the user.</li><li data-tomark-pass="">Use this token while updating the user's password.</li></ul>**Acceptance Criteria:**\n<ul data-tomark-pass=""><li data-tomark-pass="">A secure, unique token is generated and stored in a database for password reset functionality.</li><li data-tomark-pass="">The token is linked to a user’s account and includes an expiration time.</li><li data-tomark-pass="">The reset password email includes a valid token link.</li></ul><br data-tomark-pass="">\n**Note:**\n<ul>\n<li>Some work related to&nbsp;<a href="http://prom.projects4.me/app/project/cb4567905acd-06d6-1141-7dd99b59dd21/issue/3479">#3479</a>&nbsp;is done here to get system user, because user is not authorized therefore we need to set currentUser to system to make things in a workable state.</li>\n</ul>\n	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	3490	2024-12-02	2024-12-02	done	medium	cb4567905acd-06d6-1141-7dd99b59dd21	29393e98671f-f433-141c-87c17da1ce69	\N	cbaa72735acd-06d6-1141-98f835ab32e9	Rana Nouman	Rana Nouman	\N	33f2e1c062c6-81f4-bcaf-6a1b411477d8	2024-12-02 14:18:56+00	AGAIA	0	0
