5fcd263665d2-68e6-48d2-265b780f7260	Get variable delay time	2024-02-19 07:08:15+00	2024-02-19 09:28:19+00	0	<p>We cannot give a fixed delay time during the updating of the permissions e.g. 1 sec because as the permissions update count is increased e.g. 30, So user will have to wait 1 min (excluding the XHR Patch call time).</p>\n<p>So create a function that gives us a variable time. As the permissions count increased this will reduce the delay time to 0.1 sec. Current threshold we have set is 30.</p>\n	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	3386	2024-02-19	2024-02-19	done	low	add12ff55acb-1902-6b9c-30d5411f7729	4e31873365d2-9931-48d2-91fe572f2988	\N	ae5c14575acb-1902-6b9c-78da78712ee9	Rana Nouman	Rana Nouman	\N	23a4749162c6-89cf-bcaf-50ebb8c0446b	2024-02-19 09:28:19+00	APROM	0	0
