469095726775-093f-ab18-02264a06d0ff	Append unique number in shortcode	2025-01-01 12:42:46+00	2025-01-02 07:54:48+00	0	<p>There is an issue regarding generating the shortcode against the project name. When multiple projects have the same starting name, according to our current implementation of generating the short code, we take the first 5 characters of the name and treat it as a shortcode for that specific project.</p>\n<p><strong>Implementation:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Create a behavior that takes care of the generation of the shortcode while creating the project.</li>\n<li>To add uniqueness to the shortcode the project has one word, e.g. Gaia we can add a number at the end of that.</li>\n<li>If there is already a shortcode named <strong>GAIA1</strong> then the next project's shortcode will be <strong>GAIA2</strong>.</li>\n<li>Pattern for the shortcode for the project having multiple words will be by taking the first letter of each word, combining all of these, and checking that the created shortcode exists in the database, if not available then add a number at the end of the created shortcode.</li>\n</ul>\n	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	3496	2025-01-01	2025-01-01	done	medium	cb4567905acd-06d6-1141-7dd99b59dd21	0bf1feb76775-093f-ab18-e40667212531	\N	cbaa72735acd-06d6-1141-98f835ab32e9	Rana Nouman	Rana Nouman	\N	33f2e1c062c6-81f4-bcaf-6a1b411477d8	2025-01-02 07:56:22+00	AGAIA	0	0
