4d110736678f-54a3-6b2b-f6fa6ede65f7	Add functionality to remove membership from project	2025-01-21 07:14:21+00	2025-02-18 13:40:52+00	0	<p>Implement functionality to allow users to remove a member from a project. This feature will enhance project management by enabling project administrators to remove memberships directly from the UI.</p>\n<p><strong>Purpose</strong>:<br>\nTo improve the usability of the Project Members List, allowing administrators to manage memberships efficiently.</p>\n<p><strong>Requirements</strong>:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Add a <strong>Remove Membership</strong> icon (e.g., a trash bin) next to each member's entry in the Project Members List.</li>\n<li>Clicking the Remove icon should:\n<ul>\n<li>Open a modal and show the list of users to which the current member's in-progress issues will be assigned.</li>\n<li>After user selection, we can delete the member's membership from the project.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>On confirmation:\n<ul>\n<li>Trigger an API call to remove the member's association with the project.</li>\n<li>Show a <strong>loading spinner</strong> or disable the Confirm button while the API request is in progress.</li>\n<li>On success, update the Project Members List in the UI to reflect the change.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>On failure:\n<ul>\n<li>Show a toast notification with an appropriate error message (e.g., <em>"Failed to remove membership. Please try again."</em>).</li>\n<li>Ensure the user remains on the current page.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>Acceptance Criteria</strong>:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>The Remove Membership icon is visible and correctly styled.</li>\n<li>Clicking the icon opens a modal and a user list is displayed.</li>\n<li>After confirming the action, the member is removed from the project, and the list is updated dynamically.</li>\n<li>After the confirmation, the in-progress issues of the (deleted) member are assigned to some other user (selected in the modal).</li>\n<li>Errors are handled gracefully with appropriate feedback to the user.</li>\n</ul>\n	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	3516	2025-01-22	2025-01-21	done	medium	add12ff55acb-1902-6b9c-30d5411f7729	d887604167a0-5985-d8e3-056674b53f37	\N	ae5c14575acb-1902-6b9c-78da78712ee9	Rana Nouman	Rana Nouman	\N	23a4749162c6-89cf-bcaf-50ebb8c0446b	2025-02-18 13:51:46+00	APROM	0	0
