5e0ecca9673f-2778-11fd-76e4bceb1be5	Upgrade the release using helm	2024-11-21 12:15:26+00	2024-11-21 13:13:51+00	0	<p>Currently, using the helm upgrade command, we were not able to pull the docker image from the docker hub because our deployments for both Gaia use the "<strong>dev-latest</strong>" tag with it, which was not updated at the time. So Helm considers this as the same image that's why in our CD workflow, when we tried to deploy our latest docker image using Helm upgrade, it was not updating the release with the updated new image the <strong>dev-latest</strong> tag.</p>\n<p><strong>Actual Behavior:</strong><br>\nhelm upgrade isn't updating the release with the latest image.</p>\n<p><strong>Expected Behavior:</strong><br>\nhelm upgrade in the CD workflow should update the&nbsp;dev/qa release.</p>\n<p><strong>Solution:</strong><br>\nHelm needs to change in the deployment object, so we're adding a new label e.g. date: "{{ now | unixEpoch }}" under <strong>labels</strong>. Every time there is a new date helm detects a change in the deployment object and will pull the image every time.</p>\n	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	1	3483	2024-11-21	2024-11-21	done	medium	cb4567905acd-06d6-1141-7dd99b59dd21	29393e98671f-f433-141c-87c17da1ce69	\N	cb9597e45acd-06d6-1141-34137d85f7a9	Rana Nouman	Hammad Hassan	0f89d429673f-ef36-e2a1-70a5b6432cd4	33f2e1c062c6-81f4-bcaf-6a1b411477d8	2024-11-21 13:07:38+00	AGAIA	0	0
