61c18ba3673f-2778-11fd-144f79de164c	Upgrade the release using helm	2024-11-21 12:15:29+00	2024-11-21 12:15:29+00	0	<p>Currently, using the helm upgrade command, we were not able to pull the docker image from the docker hub because our deployments for both Prometheus use the "<strong>dev-latest</strong>" tag with it, which was not updated at the time. So Helm considers this as the same image that's why in our CD workflow, when we tried to deploy our latest docker image using Helm upgrade, it was not updating the release with the updated new image the <strong>dev-latest</strong> tag.</p>\n<p><strong>Actual Behavior:</strong><br>\nhelm upgrade isn't updating the release with the latest image.</p>\n<p><strong>Expected Behavior:</strong><br>\nhelm upgrade in the CD workflow should update the&nbsp;dev/qa release.</p>\n<p><strong>Solution:</strong><br>\nHelm needs to change in the deployment object, so we're adding a new label e.g. date: "{{ now | unixEpoch }}" under <strong>labels</strong>. Every time there is a new date helm detects a change in the deployment object and will pull the image every time.</p>\n	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	3484	2024-11-21	2024-11-21	done	medium	add12ff55acb-1902-6b9c-30d5411f7729	4f15ca76671f-f433-141c-9f9c0a0f1306	\N	ae61a7235acb-1902-6b9c-e933ed4dfda0	Rana Nouman	Rana Nouman	\N	23a4749162c6-89cf-bcaf-50ebb8c0446b	2024-11-21 13:06:10+00	APROM	0	0
