72d873f0673c-7fa9-9cdd-c3652212eda6	Exclude Secure Fields from API Payload 	2024-11-19 11:24:34+00	2025-03-27 17:05:21+00	0	<p><strong>Objective:</strong><br>\nThe current implementation of API includes sensitive fields e.g. <strong>lastFailedAttempts</strong>,&nbsp;<strong>failedLoginAttempts</strong>,&nbsp;<strong>rememberMe</strong>, etc which could expose sensitive information. To avoid that we have to make a mechanism through which we can exclude the fields which we need to. This will make our system more secure.</p>\n<p><br data-tomark-pass=""><br>\n<strong>Implementation:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Add a field/attribute/flag in each field of metadata that tells API that this field shouldn't be part of the payload.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><br data-tomark-pass=""><br>\n<strong>Acceptance Criteria:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>While getting a Model from an API that has sensitive fields, the payload shouldn't contain that field.</li>\n<li>If the model becomes a relationship in the payload, there should also be no sensitive field inside that payload.</li>\n</ul>\n	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	3481	2024-11-19	2024-11-19	done	medium	cb4567905acd-06d6-1141-7dd99b59dd21	c7087d0967da-2290-3820-a361b66b5f6a	\N	cbaa72735acd-06d6-1141-98f835ab32e9	Rana Nouman	Rana Nouman	3b20cf61673c-88fd-7e79-06e3976087c8	33f2e1c062c6-81f4-bcaf-6a1b411477d8	2025-03-27 17:48:51+00	AGAIA	0	0
