a9490b57674e-cdab-fa7d-8cd0d8f56405	Create reset password page	2024-12-03 09:34:33+00	2024-12-04 14:53:49+00	0	<p>We need to create a page that allows users to reset their password. This is part of the user authentication flow, where users who have forgotten their passwords can securely reset them.</p>\n<p><strong>Implementation:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Create a separate route named <strong>reset-password</strong>.</li>\n<li>Add two fields enter password and confirm password.</li>\n<li>This route will only be rendered when the reset token is valid and has not expired.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><br data-tomark-pass=""><br>\n<strong>Acceptance Criteria:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>The reset password page should be accessible at a defined route e.g. reset-password.</li>\n<li>Successful submission should trigger a success message and redirect the user to the login page.</li>\n<li>Password strength should be evaluated according to basic security standards.</li>\n</ul>\n	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	3491	2024-12-03	2024-12-03	done	medium	add12ff55acb-1902-6b9c-30d5411f7729	4f15ca76671f-f433-141c-9f9c0a0f1306	\N	ae5c14575acb-1902-6b9c-78da78712ee9	Rana Nouman	Rana Nouman	\N	23a4749162c6-89cf-bcaf-50ebb8c0446b	2024-12-04 14:53:49+00	APROM	0	0
