b0ce924365d8-ce57-cd56-7e2316c200d2	Handle ACL for the project dependent model	2024-02-23 11:08:32+00	2024-02-26 09:28:43+00	0	<p>Until now we had covered almost all of the cases regarding the ACL but by the time new cases emerge,&nbsp; we have to cover these also.</p>\n<p>Currently, if the model is project dependent e.g. Issue, it must contain the projectId field. But the models such as Membership, a user has a membership on a project so it should contain <strong>projectId</strong> but in our case it is <strong>relatedId</strong> instead of <strong>projectId.</strong></p>\n<p>So when a model is project dependent (2 access level) &nbsp;and it doesn't has projectId field in it then while applying ACL we got error:<br>\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="colour" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);" data-tomark-pass=""><strong>Unknown column 'Membership.projectId'in 'where clause' in /var/www/html/core/mvc/models/Model.php:401</strong></span></p>\n<p><br data-tomark-pass=""><br>\nSo lets handle this case <span data-tomark-pass="">?</span></p>\n	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	3394	2024-02-23	2024-02-23	done	high	cb4567905acd-06d6-1141-7dd99b59dd21	fe5a5b6965d3-916e-7f94-ed3e7b689902	\N	cb9597e45acd-06d6-1141-34137d85f7a9	Rana Nouman	Rana Nouman	\N	33f2e1c062c6-81f4-bcaf-6a1b411477d8	2024-02-26 09:28:43+00	AGAIA	0	0
