c555c009671f-9ee4-c519-ccad48855e85	Lock User functionality after multiple failed login attempts	2024-10-28 12:00:05+00	2024-11-18 15:19:14+00	0	<p><strong>Objective:</strong><br>\nTo enhance the security of the authentication process, implement a user profile lock functionality that prevents further login attempts after multiple failed login attempts, protecting against brute-force attacks and unauthorized access attempts.</p>\n<p><strong>Implementation:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Add two new fields in the user model e.g.&nbsp;<strong>failedLoginAttempts</strong>,&nbsp;<strong>lastFailedAttempt</strong>.</li>\n<li>Track the number of failed login attempts.</li>\n<li>Lock the user after 5 failed attempts.</li>\n<li>Prevent further login attempts until the lock time period expires.</li>\n<li>Reset the failed login attempt count after a successful login or after the lock period expires.</li>\n<li>Throw relevant exceptions when the user profile is locked.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Acceptance Criteria</strong>:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Account lock occurs after exceeding the failed login attempts threshold (set in<b data-tomark-pass="">oauth</b> configuration).</li>\n<li>User are notified by proper message.</li>\n<li>The failed attempts counter is reset after a successful login or after the lock expiration time.</li>\n<li>Code is well-tested, and no further attempts can be made after the account is locked.</li>\n</ul>\n	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	3451	2024-10-28	2024-10-28	done	medium	cb4567905acd-06d6-1141-7dd99b59dd21	29393e98671f-f433-141c-87c17da1ce69	\N	cbaa72735acd-06d6-1141-98f835ab32e9	Rana Nouman	Rana Nouman	\N	33f2e1c062c6-81f4-bcaf-6a1b411477d8	2024-11-19 06:30:21+00	AGAIA	0	0
