d0e40d716814-253c-eb39-39e9b83faa26	Field's model containing "Not" in the name is not working	2025-05-02 12:51:28+00	2025-05-05 09:20:07+00	0	<p>I have created a Notification model. When I tried to GET the notifications using the API I got the following error:</p>\n<p><br data-tomark-pass=""><br>\n<br data-tomark-pass=""></p>\n<pre><code>PhalconException: Unknown model or alias 'abc' (11), when preparing: SELECT Notabc.id, Notabc.name FROM\n[Gaia\\MVC\\Models\\Notabc] AS [Notabc] LIMIT :APL0:\n</code></pre>\n<p>After some research, saw that this is the reserved keyword used by <a href="https://github.com/phalcon/cphalcon/issues/16502">Phalcon PHP</a>.</p>\n<p>Resolve this issue so that we can easily use the models that contains the Not keyword instead of using some other names.</p>\n	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	3622	2025-05-03	2025-05-02	deferred	medium	cb4567905acd-06d6-1141-7dd99b59dd21	577f37e36807-3fc4-4940-88f3b7c22a71	\N	cbaa72735acd-06d6-1141-98f835ab32e9	Rana Nouman	Rana Nouman	\N	6127443762c6-81f4-bcaf-98ca7149ed20	2025-05-05 09:20:07+00	AGAIA	0	0
