d3509fb46737-16a9-7741-43ff360b2423	Caching related actions not working on CI	2024-11-15 11:30:27+00	2025-01-30 10:16:22+00	0	<p><strong>Description:</strong><br>\nThe CI workflow is breaking while running&nbsp;<em>tj-actions/changed-files</em>action. This action is used to watch changes in composer.json, if there is a change then the next step of CI pipeline will use this step's output to install the composer's dependencies. Below is the screenshot of the issue.<br>\n<img src="data:image/png;base64," alt="image.png"><br>\nThis issue is resolved when we try to switch from rananoman/gaia:env-dev image from gaia:1.0.0 tagged image in CI workflow file, which is weird behavior.</p>\n<p><strong>Impact:</strong><br>\nThis issue prevents us from caching the Gaia dependencies and will increase the overall execution time of the CI pipeline.</p>\n<p><strong>Expected Behavior:</strong><br>\nThe action should detect changes between commits and update caches accordingly to optimize build time.</p>\n	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	3478	2024-11-15	2024-11-15	done	high	cb4567905acd-06d6-1141-7dd99b59dd21	29393e98671f-f433-141c-87c17da1ce69	\N	cb9597e45acd-06d6-1141-34137d85f7a9	Rana Nouman	Rana Nouman	\N	33f2e1c062c6-81f4-bcaf-6a1b411477d8	2025-01-30 10:16:22+00	AGAIA	0	0
