fce9c4e3672c-6695-2383-a553e5f1c9e6	Convert OAuth server to class based implementation	2024-11-07 09:48:44+00	2024-11-11 12:08:07+00	0	<p><strong>Objective:</strong><br>\nRefactor the current OAuth server implementation to follow a class-based architecture. This change will make the OAuth server more modular, testable, and maintainable.</p>\n<p><strong>Tasks</strong>:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Identify the current procedural OAuth server implementation.</li>\n<li>Create a class structure and identify/write down the code in more modular approach.</li>\n<li>Use the specific function to initiate the OAuth server call instead of including file using require_once e.g.</li>\n</ol>\n<pre><code>include_once APP_PATH.'/core/libs/authorization/oAuthServer.php';\n</code></pre>\n<p><strong>Acceptance Criteria:</strong><br>\n<br data-tomark-pass=""></p>\n<ul>\n<li>The OAuth server is fully refactored into a class-based structure.</li>\n<li>OAuth authentication flows (Authorization Code, Client Credentials, and Refresh Tokens) continue to work as expected.</li>\n<li>The code base is modular and easy to maintain.</li>\n</ul>\n	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	3474	2024-11-07	2024-11-07	done	medium	cb4567905acd-06d6-1141-7dd99b59dd21	29393e98671f-f433-141c-87c17da1ce69	\N	cbaa72735acd-06d6-1141-98f835ab32e9	Rana Nouman	Rana Nouman	\N	33f2e1c062c6-81f4-bcaf-6a1b411477d8	2024-11-11 12:08:07+00	AGAIA	0	0
