d8407cc268da-33c7-2655-8fffa9e9bc1c	Create project activities list component	2025-09-29 10:39:20+00	2026-04-23 14:32:58+00	0	<p>Develop an EmberJS component to display the list of project activities. The component should show activities in a structured format using Bootstrap 3 styling, include basic information like activity name, status, and dates. Implement responsive design and proper loading states.</p>\n<hr>\n<p><strong>Test Cases (3):</strong><br>\n<strong>Scenario:</strong> <span data-tomark-pass="">Activities list displays correctly</span><br>\n<strong>Test Case:</strong><br>\n<code class="issue-plan-test-case-pre" data-te-codeblock="" data-tomark-pass="">Given project activities exist<br data-tomark-pass=""><br>\nWhen I navigate to the project activities page<br data-tomark-pass=""><br>\nThen I should see a list of activities<br data-tomark-pass=""><br>\nAnd each activity should display name, status, and dates<br data-tomark-pass=""><br>\nAnd the layout should be responsive</code></p>\n<p><strong>Scenario:</strong> <span data-tomark-pass="">Empty state handling</span><br>\n<strong>Test Case:</strong><br>\n<code class="issue-plan-test-case-pre" data-te-codeblock="" data-tomark-pass="">Given a project has no activities<br data-tomark-pass=""><br>\nWhen I view the activities list<br data-tomark-pass=""><br>\nThen I should see an appropriate empty state message<br data-tomark-pass=""><br>\nAnd a call-to-action to add activities</code></p>\n<p><strong>Scenario:</strong> <span data-tomark-pass="">Loading state display</span><br>\n<strong>Test Case:</strong><br>\n<code class="issue-plan-test-case-pre" data-te-codeblock="" data-tomark-pass="">Given activities are being loaded<br data-tomark-pass=""><br>\nWhen the component is fetching data<br data-tomark-pass=""><br>\nThen it should display a loading spinner or skeleton<br data-tomark-pass=""><br>\nAnd disable user interactions appropriately</code></p>\n	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	1	1	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	3649	2026-04-24	2026-04-08	in_review	medium	add12ff55acb-1902-6b9c-30d5411f7729	9c6b986068ec-2981-8d50-efb4b1d23f27	\N	ae5a3c325acb-1902-6b9c-e93d4161f6f9	Rana Nouman	Rana Nouman	\N	f605b4e862c6-4e44-047e-0b80b34dd385	2026-04-23 14:32:58+00	APROM	0	1
