d91b243068da-33c7-2655-e10a9bb3903e	Implement delete activity functionality	2025-09-29 10:39:21+00	2026-04-20 09:08:03+00	0	Add the ability to delete project activities with proper confirmation dialog. Implement soft delete if required, provide undo functionality, and ensure proper error handling. Include appropriate user permissions checking.\n<hr>\n<div>\n<strong>Test Cases (3):</strong>\n</div>\n\n<div>\n<strong>Scenario:</strong> <span>Delete confirmation dialog</span>\n</div>\n<div><strong>Test Case:</strong> <pre class="issue-plan-test-case-pre">Given an activity exists in the list\nWhen I click the delete button\nThen a confirmation dialog should appear\nAnd I should be able to confirm or cancel the deletion</pre></div>\n<br>\n\n<div>\n<strong>Scenario:</strong> <span>Successfully delete activity</span>\n</div>\n<div><strong>Test Case:</strong> <pre class="issue-plan-test-case-pre">Given I have confirmed deletion of an activity\nWhen the delete operation completes\nThen the activity should be removed from the list\nAnd I should see a success message\nAnd the list should update automatically</pre></div>\n<br>\n\n<div>\n<strong>Scenario:</strong> <span>Delete operation error handling</span>\n</div>\n<div><strong>Test Case:</strong> <pre class="issue-plan-test-case-pre">Given a delete operation fails\nWhen the server returns an error\nThen an error message should be displayed\nAnd the activity should remain in the list\nAnd the user should be able to retry</pre></div>\n<br>\n	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	1	ac62498068b6-74ed-dac0-65093b7d9f4a	1	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	3650	2025-09-29	2025-09-27	new	medium	add12ff55acb-1902-6b9c-30d5411f7729	9c6b986068ec-2981-8d50-efb4b1d23f27	daaa8c5068da-33c7-2655-f1ac7460732b	ae5a3c325acb-1902-6b9c-e93d4161f6f9	Rana Nouman	Rana Nouman	5a9d6c81690d-dbb4-1f33-5c2c040ff1f7	bf3f206262c6-8e43-047e-2160cab7abb6	2026-04-13 14:36:27+00	APROM	0	1
