d9e46d7068da-33c7-2655-66e6f1891ce2	Integrate activities into project navigation and routing	2025-09-29 10:39:21+00	2026-04-20 09:08:01+00	0	<p>Add project activities to the main project navigation menu, set up proper EmberJS routes for activities pages, implement breadcrumbs, and ensure proper URL structure. Configure route permissions and loading states.</p>\n<hr>\n<p><strong>Test Cases (3):</strong><br>\n<strong>Scenario:</strong> <span data-tomark-pass="">Activities navigation menu item</span><br>\n<strong>Test Case:</strong><br>\n<code class="issue-plan-test-case-pre" data-te-codeblock="" data-tomark-pass="">Given I am viewing a project<br>\nWhen I look at the project navigation menu<br>\nThen I should see an 'Activities' menu item<br>\nAnd clicking it should navigate to the activities page</code><br data-tomark-pass=""><br>\n<br data-tomark-pass=""><br>\n<strong>Scenario:</strong> <span data-tomark-pass="">Proper URL routing</span><br>\n<strong>Test Case:</strong><br>\n<code class="issue-plan-test-case-pre" data-te-codeblock="" data-tomark-pass="">Given the activities functionality is integrated<br>\nWhen I navigate to project activities URLs directly<br>\nThen the correct page should load<br>\nAnd the URL should be user-friendly and bookmarkable</code><br data-tomark-pass=""><br>\n<br data-tomark-pass=""><br>\n<strong>Scenario:</strong> <span data-tomark-pass="">Breadcrumb navigation</span><br>\n<strong>Test Case:</strong><br>\n<code class="issue-plan-test-case-pre" data-te-codeblock="" data-tomark-pass="">Given I am on the project activities page<br>\nWhen I view the breadcrumb navigation<br>\nThen it should show Project &gt; Activities<br>\nAnd each breadcrumb level should be clickable</code></p>\n	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	1	1	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	3651	2025-09-07	2025-09-06	new	blocker	add12ff55acb-1902-6b9c-30d5411f7729	9c6b986068ec-2981-8d50-efb4b1d23f27	\N	ae5a3c325acb-1902-6b9c-e93d4161f6f9	R