daaa8c5068da-33c7-2655-f1ac7460732b	Implement activities filtering and search	2025-09-29 10:39:22+00	2026-05-19 11:15:06+00	0	Add search and filtering capabilities to the activities list. Implement client-side filtering by status, date range, and text search. Include filter controls in the UI with proper Bootstrap 3 styling and ensure good performance with large activity lists.\n<hr>\n<div>\n<strong>Test Cases (3):</strong>\n</div>\n\n<div>\n<strong>Scenario:</strong> <span>Search activities by text</span>\n</div>\n<div><strong>Test Case:</strong> <pre class="issue-plan-test-case-pre">Given multiple activities exist\nWhen I enter text in the search field\nThen the activities list should filter to show only matching activities\nAnd the search should work on activity names and descriptions</pre></div>\n<br>\n\n<div>\n<strong>Scenario:</strong> <span>Filter activities by status</span>\n</div>\n<div><strong>Test Case:</strong> <pre class="issue-plan-test-case-pre">Given activities with different statuses exist\nWhen I select a status filter\nThen only activities with that status should be displayed\nAnd the filter should update the list in real-time</pre></div>\n<br>\n\n<div>\n<strong>Scenario:</strong> <span>Clear filters functionality</span>\n</div>\n<div><strong>Test Case:</strong> <pre class="issue-plan-test-case-pre">Given filters are applied to the activities list\nWhen I click the clear filters button\nThen all filters should be reset\nAnd the full list of activities should be displayed</pre></div>\n<br>\n	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	1	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	1	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	3652	2025-09-27	2025-09-24	deferred	medium	add12ff55acb-1902-6b9c-30d5411f7729	2885dd2068cd-5e75-a443-61f949489d90	d9e46d7068da-33c7-2655-66e6f1891ce2	ae5a3c325acb-1902-6b9c-e93d4161f6f9	Rana Nouman	Rana Nouman	\N	d293f53862c6-8e43-047e-1fffdc448fcf	2026-04-27 11:34:46+00	APROM	0	1
db97d7f668da-33c7-2655-97366b65a8ec	Implement add new activity functionality	2025-09-29 10:39:23+00	2026-04-23 14:10:13+00	0	Create a form component and modal dialog for adding new project activities. Include form validation, proper input fields for activity details, and integration with the activities service. Use Bootstrap 3 modal components and form styling.\n<hr>\n<div>\n<strong>Test Cases (3):</strong>\n</div>\n\n<div>\n<strong>Scenario:</strong> <span>Add activity form validation</span>\n</div>\n<div><strong>Test Case:</strong> <pre class="issue-plan-test-case-pre">Given the add activity form is open\nWhen I submit the form with invalid or missing data\nThen validation errors should be displayed\nAnd the form should not submit\nAnd required fields should be highlighted</pre></div>\n<br>\n\n<div>\n<strong>Scenario:</strong> <span>Successfully add new activity</span>\n</div>\n<div><strong>Test Case:</strong> <pre class="issue-plan-test-case-pre">Given the add activity form is open\nWhen I fill in valid activity details and submit\nThen the activity should be created\nAnd I should see a success message\nAnd the modal should close\nAnd the activities list should refresh</pre></div>\n<br>\n\n<div>\n<strong>Scenario:</strong> <span>Form cancellation handling</span>\n</div>\n<div><strong>Test Case:</strong> <pre class="issue-plan-test-case-pre">Given the add activity form is partially filled\nWhen I click cancel or close the modal\nThen the form should close without saving\nAnd any unsaved changes should be discarded\nAnd I should return to the activities list</pre></div>\n<br>\n	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	1	1	1	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	3653	2025-09-28	2025-09-26	in_review	medium	add12ff55acb-1902-6b9c-30d5411f7729	2885dd2068cd-5e75-a443-61f949489d90	daaa8c5068da-33c7-2655-f1ac7460732b	ae5a3c325acb-1902-6b9c-e93d4161f6f9	Rana Nouman	Rana Nouman	505aad9869d3-916e-35ff-9026c5560fca	f605b4e862c6-4e44-047e-0b80b34dd385	2026-04-23 14:10:13+00	APROM	0	1
dc4fd10068da-33c7-2655-74c4ecb85b32	Implement edit activity functionality	2025-09-29 10:39:24+00	2026-04-23 14:10:30+00	0	Create functionality to edit existing project activities. Implement an edit form (can reuse components from add functionality), pre-populate fields with existing data, handle updates through the service, and provide appropriate user feedback.\n<hr>\n<div>\n<strong>Test Cases (3):</strong>\n</div>\n\n<div>\n<strong>Scenario:</strong> <span>Edit form pre-population</span>\n</div>\n<div><strong>Test Case:</strong> <pre class="issue-plan-test-case-pre">Given an existing activity\nWhen I click edit on the activity\nThen the edit form should open\nAnd all fields should be pre-populated with current data\nAnd I should be able to modify the values</pre></div>\n<br>\n\n<div>\n<strong>Scenario:</strong> <span>Successfully update activity</span>\n</div>\n<div><strong>Test Case:</strong> <pre class="issue-plan-test-case-pre">Given the edit activity form is open with existing data\nWhen I modify the activity details and submit\nThen the activity should be updated\nAnd I should see a success message\nAnd the activities list should reflect the changes</pre></div>\n<br>\n\n<div>\n<strong>Scenario:</strong> <span>Edit form validation</span>\n</div>\n<div><strong>Test Case:</strong> <pre class="issue-plan-test-case-pre">Given the edit activity form is open\nWhen I clear required fields and submit\nThen validation errors should be displayed\nAnd the form should not submit until valid</pre></div>\n<br>\n	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	1	1	1	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	3654	2025-09-28	2025-09-26	in_progress	medium	add12ff55acb-1902-6b9c-30d5411f7729	2885dd2068cd-5e75-a443-61f949489d90	\N	ae5a3c325acb-1902-6b9c-e93d4161f6f9	Rana Nouman	Rana Nouman	fbe58f8369d0-3744-aec0-5caf2f9b3277	f605b4e862c6-8e43-047e-0b80b37dd385	2026-04-23 14:10:05+00	APROM	0	1
