dd2c7e166839-c42c-41fa-f58f6f912041	Nested loops are not breaking properly	2025-05-30 15:59:25+00	2025-06-04 07:59:39+00	0	<p>There are nested loops in getRelationshipMeta in file meta/manager.php which get the relationship name and returns the relationship meta. Once the inner loop got the relationship meta it breaks the loop (inner) where as the outer loop still works and if there is something more to come in outer loop then eventually the code breaks!</p>\n<p>So remove this and just return from the function if got relationship meta.</p>\n	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	1	1	1	3636	2025-05-31	2025-05-30	done	medium	cb4567905acd-06d6-1141-7dd99b59dd21	548923c46839-2420-41fa-8f1a38f6d9d0	\N	cbaa72735acd-06d6-1141-98f835ab32e9	Rana Nouman	Hammad Hassan	\N	33f2e1c062c6-81f4-bcaf-6a1b411477d8	2025-05-30 16:03:40+00	AGAIA	0	0
ddacbd486812-1c66-eb4e-971cdb1ee3d0	Create Notifications Module (Model and API)	2025-04-30 13:17:17+00	2025-05-22 15:41:02+00	0	<p>Implement a complete notifications system for the application backend, including data model and REST API endpoints. This module will enable the application to create, store, retrieve, and manage user notifications.</p>\n<p><strong>Technical Requirements:</strong><br>\n- Create database schema for notifications (with fields for type, user_id, content, read status, timestamp, etc.)<br>\n- Implement Phalcon model for Notifications with appropriate relationships<br>\n- Develop REST API endpoints:<br>\n&nbsp; * GET /api/notifications (list notifications, with pagination and filtering)<br>\n&nbsp; * GET /api/notifications/{id} (get single notification)<br>\n- Add notification service layer for business logic (if needed).<br>\n- Implement basic notification types (system, user-to-user)</p>\n<p><strong>Acceptance Criteria:</strong><br>\n-&nbsp; The notification model correctly validates all required fields<br>\n-&nbsp; All API endpoints return appropriate responses and status codes<br>\n-&nbsp; API endpoints are secured with proper authentication<br>\n-&nbsp; Code follows project coding standards</p>\n	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	3621	2025-05-02	2025-04-30	done	medium	cb4567905acd-06d6-1141-7dd99b59dd21	a56d0c46682c-5c87-b50b-97175e361f54	\N	cbaa72735acd-06d6-1141-98f835ab32e9	Rana Nouman	Rana Nouman	\N	33f2e1c062c6-81f4-bcaf-6a1b411477d8	2025-05-22 15:41:02+00	AGAIA	0	0
