68ee04b05a38-4b68-32a1-4baeaf1c208d	Home	2017-12-18 12:09:12+00	2017-12-18 12:09:12+00	1	Hammad Hassan	1	Hammad Hassan	0	published	0	1	22a2c5915a35-9c67-ae8f-ea2fd3c4e50a	<p style="text-align: center; "><img src="data:image/png;base64," data-filename="logo.png" style="width: 67.0156px; float: none; height: 67.0156px;" class=""><u><br></u></p><h3><u>Introduction</u></h3><p><br></p><p>Prometheus is an open source project management and team collaboration software which is designed to give even the large enterprise project management tools a run for their money. The reason to have this a separate tool is because it packs its own feature set and is quite independent of the Phalcon based Gaia' backend system.</p><p><br></p><h3><u>Technology Stack</u></h3><p>Prometheus is based on EmberJS using EmberCLI and AdminLTE with bootstrap and jQuery for the front end.</p><p><br></p><h3><u>Features</u></h3><ol><li>Project Management</li><li>Chat</li><li>Issue Management</li><li>Dashboard with virtual assistance</li><li>Conversations</li><li>Reports</li><li>WIki based documentation</li><li>Kanban style project board</li><li>Calandar</li></ol><p><br></p><h3><u>License</u></h3><p>Like Gaia it is distributed under AGLPv3 with mandatory attribution clause.</p><p><br></p>	\N
